OL,3,GNEWSAShould schools get to dictate our
OL,4,Achildren's hair?
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people are returning to the
OL,7,Fclassroom after the summer break - and
OL,8,Ffor many that means a back-to-school
OL,9,Fhaircut.
OL,11,FMany schools still insist students
OL,12,Favoid "extreme" styles, with tramlines,
OL,13,Fskin fades, braids and "unnatural"
OL,14,Fcolours appearing on ban lists.
OL,16,FOne school in Lincolnshire insists all
OL,17,Fstudents tie back long hair as matter
OL,18,Fof course.
OL,20,FBut what do others think?
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
